        "# 2. Understanding Model Repository IDs\n",
        "\n",
        "A Hugging Face model repository ID uniquely identifies a model repository on the Hub.\n",
        "\n",
        "General format:\n",
        "\n",
        "`organization_or_username/model_name`\n",
        "\n",
        "Examples:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct`\n",
        "- `google/flan-t5-base`\n",
        "- `openai-community/gpt2`\n",
        "\n",
        "A model repository ID is used by Hub and Transformers functions to identify the model whose files or metadata we want to access.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Important considerations\n",
        "\n",
        "- Repository IDs are case-sensitive identifiers in practice; use the exact ID provided by the Hub.\n",
        "- Some repositories are public, while others require authentication or permission.\n",
        "- A repository can contain multiple model files and configuration files.\n",
        "- A repository can contain multiple branches and revisions.\n",
        "- A model may require a specific Transformers version or custom code.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Best practice:** Always inspect the model card, architecture, license and supported tasks before using a model in a project.\n",
        ":::"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "LuXha1s_f28e"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 3. Connecting to Hugging Face Hub\n",
        "\n",
        "The `huggingface_hub` Python library provides programmatic access to the Hugging Face Hub.\n",
        "\n",
        "The main interface for interacting with the Hub is `HfApi`.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Important classes and functions\n",
        "\n",
        "- `HfApi`: Main API client for interacting with Hub repositories.\n",
        "- `model_info()`: Retrieves metadata about a model repository.\n",
        "- `list_models()`: Searches and lists available models.\n",
        "- `list_repo_files()`: Lists files inside a repository.\n",
        "- `hf_hub_download()`: Downloads an individual file from a repository.\n",
        "- `snapshot_download()`: Downloads an entire repository snapshot.\n",
        "- `login()`: Authenticates with Hugging Face when necessary.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Basic workflow\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Import HfApi.\n",
        "2. Create an API client.\n",
        "3. Provide a model repository ID.\n",
        "4. Call the appropriate API method.\n",
        "5. Inspect the returned information.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important:** Most public Hub repositories can be inspected without authentication. Private and gated repositories require appropriate access permissions.\n",
        ":::Code cell 1 — Install and import"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TMGRpa5jiBAL"
      }
