      "source": [
        "# 4. Searching for Models\n",
        "\n",
        "Hugging Face provides model-search functionality through `HfApi.list_models()`.\n",
        "\n",
        "It allows us to discover models based on:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Task or pipeline type\n",
        "- Organization or author\n",
        "- Search keywords\n",
        "- Download counts\n",
        "- Likes\n",
        "- Model library\n",
        "- Other available filters\n",
        "\n",
        "Important parameters:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `filter`: Filters models by supported task or tags.\n",
        "- `author`: Filters by model publisher.\n",
        "- `search`: Searches model names and descriptions.\n",
        "- `sort`: Specifies the field used for sorting.\n",
        "- `direction`: Controls ascending or descending order.\n",
        "- `limit`: Limits the number of returned models.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "Searching for popular text-generation models and sorting by downloads.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important:** Search ranking does not determine whether a model is suitable for your project. Always inspect its architecture, license, size, and requirements.\n"
      ],
