        "# 6. Listing Repository Files\n",
        "\n",
        "Hugging Face repositories contain different files depending on the model architecture, tokenizer implementation and storage format.\n",
        "\n",
        "The `HfApi.list_repo_files()` method retrieves the filenames available inside a repository.\n",
        "\n",
        "Important parameters:\n",
        "\n",
        "- `repo_id`: Repository identifier.\n",
        "- `repo_type`: Repository category, such as model, dataset or space.\n",
        "- `revision`: Branch, tag or commit to inspect.\n",
        "\n",
        "For model repositories, the default repository type is generally `model`.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Common model repository files\n",
        "\n",
        "- `config.json`: Model architecture configuration.\n",
        "- `model.safetensors`: Model weights, when stored in this format.\n",
        "- `model.safetensors.index.json`: Weight-shard index for sharded models.\n",
        "- `tokenizer.json`: Tokenizer data and configuration.\n",
        "- `tokenizer_config.json`: Tokenizer settings.\n",
        "- `special_tokens_map.json`: Special token mappings.\n",
        "- `generation_config.json`: Generation defaults.\n",
        "- `README.md`: Model card and documentation.\n",
        "\n",
        "Not every model contains every file.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important:** Listing repository files does not download the actual model weights."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "habfvIH9moRK"
      }
    },
